/*
 * Hardkernel Odroid XU3-Lite board device tree source
 *
 * Copyright (c) 2015 Krzysztof Kozlowski
 * Copyright (c) 2014 Collabora Ltd.
 * Copyright (c) 2013 Samsung Electronics Co., Ltd.
