 *  Copyright (C) 2017 Alexander Graf <agraf@suse.de>
 *
 *  Based on zynq-zed.dts which is:
 *  Copyright (C) 2011 - 2014 Xilinx
 *  Copyright (C) 2012 National Instruments Corp.
