/*
 * Samsung Exynos5433 TM2E board device tree source
 *
 * Copyright (c) 2016 Samsung Electronics Co., Ltd.
 *
 * Device tree source file for Samsung's TM2E(TM2 EDGE) board which is based on
 * Samsung Exynos5433 SoC.
