/*
 * Device Tree file for Freescale LS2088A QDS Board.
 *
 * Copyright 2016 Freescale Semiconductor, Inc.
 * Copyright 2017 NXP
 *
 * Abhimanyu Saini <abhimanyu.saini@nxp.com>
