			MX8MQ_IOMUXC_SD2_DATA0_USDHC2_DATA0		0xdc
			MX8MQ_IOMUXC_SD2_DATA1_USDHC2_DATA1		0xdc
			MX8MQ_IOMUXC_SD2_DATA2_USDHC2_DATA2		0xdc
			MX8MQ_IOMUXC_SD2_DATA3_USDHC2_DATA3		0xdc
